    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Ghost Ripper</strong>, you play as Heather, a diner waitress abducted during her night shift and held captive in an abandoned asylum haunted by a brutal killer known as \u201cThe Ghost Ripper.\u201d Explore the  remnants of the abandoned asylum, uncover the killer\u2019s dark past, and solve environmental puzzles to make it out alive \u2014 but beware, he is always watching.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694230/extras/86269d867d37b0f76c1c6824a46acdf2.poster.avif?t=1750696059\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694230/extras/86269d867d37b0f76c1c6824a46acdf2.webm?t=1750696059\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694230/extras/86269d867d37b0f76c1c6824a46acdf2.mp4?t=1750696059\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rich Story:</strong> Uncover the dark backstory of the killer through audiotapes and scattered notes hidden throughout the asylum.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Retro Aesthetic:</strong>\u00a0Immerse yourself in a nostalgic, PS1/PS2-inspired visual style, with low-poly graphics and eerie atmospheric effects that pay homage to classic survival horror games.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694230/extras/243e0429a50dfa0fd622638bfc83be18.poster.avif?t=1750696059\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694230/extras/243e0429a50dfa0fd622638bfc83be18.webm?t=1750696059\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Psychological Horror:</strong> A tense atmosphere, intense chases, and an ever-present sense of danger will keep you on edge.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stealth-Oriented Gameplay:</strong> Use stealth to avoid the killer \u2014don't make a noise.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Realistic Puzzles:</strong> Solve environment-based puzzles to progress through the asylum.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survival Horror:</strong> Manage limited resources, avoid the killer, and survive his deadly chase.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you survive the night, or will you become the next victim of the Ghost Ripper?</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Ghost Ripper</strong>, you play as Heather, a diner waitress abducted during her night shift and held captive in an abandoned asylum haunted by a brutal killer known as \u201cThe Ghost Ripper.\u201d Explore the  remnants of the abandoned asylum, uncover the killer\u2019s dark past, and solve environmental puzzles to make it out alive \u2014 but beware, he is always watching.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694230/extras/86269d867d37b0f76c1c6824a46acdf2.poster.avif?t=1750696059\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694230/extras/86269d867d37b0f76c1c6824a46acdf2.webm?t=1750696059\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694230/extras/86269d867d37b0f76c1c6824a46acdf2.mp4?t=1750696059\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rich Story:</strong> Uncover the dark backstory of the killer through audiotapes and scattered notes hidden throughout the asylum.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Retro Aesthetic:</strong>\u00a0Immerse yourself in a nostalgic, PS1/PS2-inspired visual style, with low-poly graphics and eerie atmospheric effects that pay homage to classic survival horror games.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694230/extras/243e0429a50dfa0fd622638bfc83be18.poster.avif?t=1750696059\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694230/extras/243e0429a50dfa0fd622638bfc83be18.webm?t=1750696059\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Psychological Horror:</strong> A tense atmosphere, intense chases, and an ever-present sense of danger will keep you on edge.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stealth-Oriented Gameplay:</strong> Use stealth to avoid the killer \u2014don't make a noise.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Realistic Puzzles:</strong> Solve environment-based puzzles to progress through the asylum.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survival Horror:</strong> Manage limited resources, avoid the killer, and survive his deadly chase.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you survive the night, or will you become the next victim of the Ghost Ripper?</p>",
    "short_description": "In Ghost Ripper, you play as Heather, a night-shift waitress abducted and held captive in an abandoned asylum by the infamous and sadistic serial killer known as the Ghost Ripper. Hide, survive, and uncover his dark past as you search for a way out.",
